    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20452" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτρ-ῡδόν</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>like a bunch of grapes: in
				clusters</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. πέτονται</span>, of
			bees, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.89
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				15.2.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				28.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίκτει [ὁ πολύπους] ᾠὰ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					334
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.550
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄνθη πέφυκεν β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					3.16.4
				</span></i>
			: metaph. of a crowd, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pisc.</u>
				42
			</span></i>.</div>
